<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Persetel in Brazil joint-venture with CPM.</title>
<headline>Persetel in Brazil joint-venture with CPM.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African computer group Persetel Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that it had entered into a joint-venture with Brazilian firm CPM Communicacoes e Processamento Ltda (CPM).</p>
<p>Persetel will consider taking a stake in the firm at a later date.</p>
<p>The two firms will initially pursue the establishment of a certification authority in Brazil and are also mulling projects there in high growth areas such as electronic commerce and network security.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
